   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK WaterAid 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Review WaterAid 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida is planning to appraise new support to its current partner WaterAid Sweden and need more information about the internal control and organizational structures in support of that. The assignment aims at assessing certain parts of the system for internal control of WaterAid Sweden, namely procurement, flow of funds, sub-granting, decision making structures and accounting policies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida planerar att utv&#xe4;rdera nytt st&#xf6;d till sin nuvarande partner WaterAid Sweden och beh&#xf6;ver mer information om internkontrollen och organisationsstrukturerna som st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r detta. Uppdraget syftar till att bed&#xf6;ma vissa delar av systemet f&#xf6;r internkontroll inom WaterAid Sweden, n&#xe4;mligen upphandling, medelsfl&#xf6;de, delbidrag, beslutsstrukturer och redovisningsprinciper.</narrative>
  </description>
